ress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ed3b7eb64a741d1b9f11db9a0f1e405 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fd7475d8/uploads/origins/3c3c7d90-a378-40f3-9077-d0fb918ac7e2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52f62a4f4d5331afafe06f70b7f65ed1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "hi again! I hope it's ok for me to send another request so soon, the last art you did was amazing and I would love to get some more!\n\nyou did my birthday celebration art last year and I loved it, so I would like to commission you to do one for me this year too!\n\nMy character is a gothic themed rat girl, with a mischievous and smug personality with sharp fang teeth.\n\nPlease draw her in any pose you want to. I'd like the background to include stained glass windows again if possible. I would also like for her to have red and gold heart shaped balloons with her and also a birthday cake or presents.\n\nhere are her references: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/13PfLpSF_hHTRmKWDWYbY10CJMAjnpHv4?usp=sharing\n\nthank you for considering my request again!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@krsmrina/works/86", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/dadc8d48/uploads/origins/a0fc1c11-03e7-4c74-ac50-3ec91f40b51a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f78046605195fc276920dc042906bc46", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/dadc8d48/uploads/origins/a0fc1c11-03e7-4c74-ac50-3ec91f40b51a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f78046605195fc276920dc042906bc46, https://si.imgix.net/dadc8d48/uploads/origins/a0fc1c11-03e7-4c74-ac50-3ec91f40b51a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9310eba140bdf61d9abf275633b566b6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/dadc8d48/uploads/origins/a0fc1c11-03e7-4c74-ac50-3ec91f40b51a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=58303551c5ea1d6307b19778b3295542 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！僕のキャラクターを描いてくれたら光栄です。\n\n彼女は温かくて甘いネズミの女の子で、性格は内気なお姉さんです。\n\n画像は横長で、16:9か1280×1024の比率/サイズを希望します。\n\n写真としては、居心地の良さそうな部屋で、デートシミュレーションゲーム（乙女ゲーム）をプレイしているところを見せたい。スイッチでもパソコンでも構いませんが、デートシムであることと、彼女が居心地が良さそうでゲームに没頭している様子を撮りたいです。できれば、彼女が微笑んでいて、たぶん赤面しているのがいい。\n\n背景と部屋は自由に任せるから、居心地のいい部屋にして、彼女のスタイルと色に合うようにしてほしい。\n\n私のキャラクターの参考シートへのリンクです：\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1Ml6pwsvhwN2yzhmqckUDKOJLN6lG5DRk/view?usp=sharing\n\nよろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@krsmrina/works/85", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/22cc45d9/uploads/origins/0bb81438-075b-4bd1-8b9a-a14e6fbc2b53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e060a846937a07d1972d316ba8edda89", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/22cc45d9/uploads/origins/0bb81438-075b-4bd1-8b9a-a14e6fbc2b53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e060a846937a07d1972d316ba8edda89, https://si.imgix.net/22cc45d9/uploads/origins/0bb81438-075b-4bd1-8b9a-a14e6fbc2b53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0004ec75052b12fd7ff6071c1edee5bf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/22cc45d9/uploads/origins/0bb81438-075b-4bd1-8b9a-a14e6fbc2b53?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2521c366783451f223b775498e7760c8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "hi! I loved the art you did for me last time the way you drew my vtuber was perfect! I recently got a new outfit model for my vtuber and I would love for you to draw me again\n\nShe's a gothic themed rat girl, with a mischievous and smug personality.\n\nI'd like to use it on my stream so please can it be 16:9\n\nhere are her references: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/13PfLpSF_hHTRmKWDWYbY10CJMAjnpHv4?usp=sharing\n\nI would like for you to draw her sitting back in a pose similar to the one you did here https://skeb.jp/@krsmrina/works/71 , and I want for her to have her hand up near her face with a smug and regal expression. I'd like her to be smiling with her sharp fang teeth visible if possible. \n\ncould the background include red gothic stained glass windows? and maybe some candles and candle light.\n\nthank you for considering my request!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@krsmrina/works/84", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/61946477/uploads/origins/26e17e66-18ab-4ebc-8de0-435133a81d96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ea2eecb7d99a6d8a424e4c95d63d5f26", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/61946477/uploads/origins/26e17e66-18ab-4ebc-8de0-435133a81d96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ea2eecb7d99a6d8a424e4c95d63d5f26, https://si.imgix.net/61946477/uploads/origins/26e17e66-18ab-4ebc-8de0-435133a81d96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b3faa193921a04859ac0ba7e39d609e0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/61946477/uploads/origins/26e17e66-18ab-4ebc-8de0-435133a81d96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=669d20829208337e8818c23a0a396191 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！OCのアキラ（男の子）とルミナ（女の子）を描いてほしいです！ポーズや表情は自由です。\n\nキャラクターリファレンス\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1YIWWH1r7q4ft2PNetVWHd5QhvH5WCwjw\n\n背景の雰囲気：\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1R4-YhRulIgZCcZQ_J3gS3o-31diMqVwm\n\nデザインや髪型は変えないでください。男の子は白い髪に紫の瞳。女の子の髪の色は薄いアイスブルーで、瞳の色も髪と同じです。\n\n女の子は穏やかで自信に満ち、エレガントな性格！男の子は内気で控えめなタイプだが、必要なときには躊躇なく彼女を守る。二人はまさにラブラブ（公然と愛情を注ぐカップル）です。\n\nご検討いただきありがとうございました！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@krsmrina/works/83", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3d630d0c/uploads/origins/d9bb6504-3c1c-4e62-bf7d-3c2a9f833b01?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=95bafa59a1e9593b98b5b66139fd5531", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3d630d0c/uploads/origins/d9bb6504-3c1c-4e62-bf7d-3c2a9f833b01?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompr